dsh-ops for Yan
================

This package is a Yan Agent plugin port of dsh-ops.

Upstream
--------
dsh-ops
https://github.com/T-Auto/dsh-ops
Copyright (c) the dsh-ops authors
Licensed under the MIT License.

The bundled worker executable is the unmodified win32-x64 binary from the
published npm package dsh-ops@0.4.4 (runtime/win32-x64), sha256
607e97c2ff79e0593b6ef28989b724b79d92a2af82eeb7fd02e6f0a2e1d23f0f.

Local changes
-------------
The port adds a Yan-native plugin manifest, instructions, one Skill, a stdio
MCP server (server.cjs) and tests. It exposes a read-only subset of the upstream
tool surface and does not include the upstream Bash payload or any GPL-licensed
component.

No upstream source was relicensed. The MIT license in LICENSE applies to this
port's own files; the upstream worker remains under its original MIT license.
